
# Purpose:
#   Exclude unnecessary files and sensitive local configuration
#   from the Docker build context.

# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/CoverageReports/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo

# Git
.git/
.gitignore

# Local configuration and secrets
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json
.env
.env.*

# Temporary files
**/Temp/
**/temp/
*.log

# Documentation
*.md
